{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第一次草稿　己卯十月輯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已下皆屬雜料簡門"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此門易解、不立表。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此章於戒疏中有詳表、今略。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "順今宗故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "但望一境而言。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "〔約殺戒言、餘可準此。〕"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舉尤害心"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "起尤快心"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "起隨喜心"}
